Text Processing – TryHackMe
Goal

To learn how to read and search through files using cat and grep.

Topics Covered

Viewing file contents

Searching for text inside files

Basic text processing in Linux

Commands I Used

cat – display the contents of a file

grep – search for specific text inside files

Example
touch notes.txt
echo "Hello World" > notes.txt
echo "Linux is powerful" >> notes.txt
echo "Cybersecurity is interesting" >> notes.txt

cat notes.txt                     # show file content
grep "Linux" notes.txt           # search for "Linux"
grep "Cyber" notes.txt           # search for "Cyber"
